{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:bbd70a108f0d65f4","name":"Mesh Tape Dispenser","source":{"id":"source:reference-bbd70a108f0d65f4","title":"Mesh Tape Dispenser","revision":21071,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:06:33Z","sha256":"9f307905745dc8dfbe786cf68f90d781d4a5fac15633148d8f804c1475df3663","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21071","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Mesh%20Tape%20Dispenser&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-bbd70a108f0d65f4","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 10 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Mounted on an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Appendage"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Appendage"},", a Mesh Tape Dispenser enables a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," to quickly apply ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mesh Tape"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mesh_Tape","referenceId":"reference:a5d9f0b853c68b88"}," to anything within reach of its manipulator (usually an adjacent square). In addition to its more conventional uses, an installed Mesh Tape Dispenser can be used by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," to entangle an adjacent enemy. With a successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," can hinder either the target's arms or its legs. If the target's arms are hindered, it incurs a -2 penalty to all attack rolls and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"},"-based ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"},". If the target's legs are hindered, its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," is reduced by 2 squares, and it cannot ",{"tag":"a","children":["Run"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Run","referenceId":"reference:00d60e31a4e6b834"},". If the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," has the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pin","referenceId":"reference:ff1cee74414621d8"}," feat and succeeds at an opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," check, the enemy is considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pinned"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pinned"}," until the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mesh Tape"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mesh_Tape","referenceId":"reference:a5d9f0b853c68b88"}," is removed (instead of until the start of the Droid's next turn).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
